  "observations": [
    "All 10 helpers other than commit exactly equal the documented round/base substitution and parse successfully; current source hashes equal the derivation manifest.",
    "The commit helper has exactly four intentional further edits: silicates and ironoxides source directory names, meta-autunite access dossier directory, and records_changed manifest key. No audit-binding behavior changed.",
    "An explicit hidden/ignored-independent scan of every named current helper found no round68 string, old trusted base, old counts, issue 214/215/216, or iron-sulfides owner directory. Historical retained review-base tag and round57 snapshot library are intentional provenance references.",
    "The actual require_final_audit AST passes 20 isolated adversarial fixtures, including truthy nonboolean passed, boolean unresolved count, mismatched identity/counts/issues, exact candidate coverage, changed bytes, and symlinks.",
    "Publication uses exact owned branch/head; native queue requires current exact-head check/review/preflight and active no-bypass SQUASH ALLGREEN policy. Cleanup checks the owned ref and uses a lease, and main synchronization is FF-only with preservation evidence.",
    "Hosted audit binds actual squash tree and sole parent to the reviewed tree/base and requires five exact workflows and every job, rather than accepting unrelated latest runs.",
    "Broad pages/publication/source prefixes are bounded by the final exact-input audit and committed file manifest. No unaudited arbitrary path is admitted by the audit gate."
